ve.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "38"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zdtrvG3u2Rg/hq720_live.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zdtrvG3u2Rg/maxresdefault_live.jpg", "preference": -1, "id": "40"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/zdtrvG3u2Rg/maxresdefault_live.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zdtrvG3u2Rg/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGGUgWShRMA8=&rs=AOn4CLBNRTBEmz2u6yzymgUb7d3vTMeBqA", "description": "Max Rempel has had Sarah Starr on before, but always as the one bringing news from out there. This time he tells her he knows almost nothing about her, and asks for the secrets of herself rather than the secrets of the universe.\n\nShe goes back to the beginning: a first-grader in the newspaper for reading almost three hundred books, all of them about aliens; her own book about a planet she remembers living on; vivid experiences with the Grays; and the discovery that she could read people's minds, which she learned to keep quiet about because it exposed what nobody wanted exposed. Max asks the question that runs through his telepathy series: children are born connected and are then trained to forget, so why did hers survive?\n\nFrom there they work forward. The starseed body waiting alive in stasis somewhere else. Why starseeds are always tired here, where money, work without service and life without community are frequencies they were never acclimated to. Why disclosure is an integration problem rather than an evidence problem. What the invitation to the friendly aliens would cost: stop the wars first, then restore the ecology. And what Max learned about surviving a collapse when the Soviet Union fell around him.\n\nThey do not agree about proof, and that disagreement is the best hour in it. Max wants a falsifiable genetic test, a strand of DNA in a child that came from neither parent. Sarah already feels the answer, and says spirituality and science have to stop behaving like enemies. Neither one gives way.\n\nThey close with blessings in the galactic languages and Max's initiation into telepathy: it is normal, it is permitted, it is your birthright.\n\nCHAPTERS\n0:00 Introduction: Max Rempel and Sarah Starr\n0:52 Sarah's Magic and Mission\n4:58 Future Humanity and Silent Telepathy\n7:55 Sarah's Psychic Childhood\n12:34 Starseeds, Alien Bodies, and Reincarnation\n18:54 Starseed Genetics and Disclosure\n22:53 Telepathy, Consciousness, and Scientific Evidence\n26:49 Metaphysics and Quantum Reality\n29:29 Starseed Downloads and Artificial Intelligence\n30:35 Preparing Humanity for Disclosure\n34:30 Collapse, Integration, and Community\n39:37 Psychedelic Healing, Yoga, and Community\n41:15 Artificial Intelligence, Contact, and Education\n44:54 Surviving Crisis Through Community\n48:37 Artificial Intelligence, Misinformation, and a Positive Future\n51:58 Reincarnation and Humanity's Cosmic Role\n54:58 Parallel Timelines and Shifting Reality\n57:02 Changing Perception and Choosing a Better Timeline\n1:00:26 Finding Positivity, Friendship, and Community\n1:05:27 How to Awaken Telepathy\n1:10:41 Telepathy Initiation and Blessing\n1:12:15 Sarah's Closing Message: Trust Yourself\n1:14:28 Where to Find Max and Sarah\n\nGUEST\nSarah Starr - lightworker, astrologer, researcher and experiencer. She teaches starseed origins, timeline activations, and space weather.\nhttps://www.sarahstarrofficial.com\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@sarahstarrofficial\nhttps://www.instagram.com/sarahstarrofficial\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@sarahstarrofficial\n\nHOST\nMax Rempel, Ph.D. - molecular geneticist and consciousness researcher\nhttps://maxrempel.com\nhttps://starseedgenetics.com\nhttps://postcontact.world\nhttps://neticusai.com\nhttps://hucolo.org\n\nTAKE PART\nYou can put your own DNA on the table. A starseed trio - mother, father, child - full-genome sequenced (currently about $400 per person via sequencing.com), and Max analyzes the data for free. Learn more or join the waiting list at https://starseedgenetics.com\n\nMORE FROM MAX\nYou Are Already Telepathic - Telepathy Lesson 1: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AnVvqasK1kw\nAre We Genetically Altered? (Dreamland, 2026): https://unknowncountry.com/dreamland/are-we-genetically-altered-a-geneticist-investigates-the-starseed-mystery/\nAlien DNA, Telepathy and the Coming Contact: https://youtu.be/OFo1cKraCMc\nAlien Hybridization and the Genetics of Telepathy: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K9WFbWmDUgI\nStarseed Genetics and ET DNA Resonance: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DLg6TX5il3U\nFull archive: https://maxrempel.com/interviews\n\nMax's streams come out every four weeks, and the next one is shaped by you. If this conversation raised a question, leave it in the comments and Max will take it up on the next stream.\n\nQuestion everything, stay open, and watch the sky.\n\n#Starseed #StarseedGenetics #Telepathy #SarahStarr #Contact #Disclosure #Consciousness #Lightworker #TelepathyTapes #Experiencer", "channel_id": "UCj5wGWloHE8hKHPd5kqWsJQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj5wGWloHE8hKHPd5kqWsJQ", "duration": 4523, "view_count": 15, "average_rating": null, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zdtrvG3u2Rg", "categories": null, "tags": ["Spiritual", "Extraterrestrial", "Aliens", "Channeling", "Ascension", "Soul", "Spirit", "God", "Jim Charles", "Channeling Messages", "ET Civilizations", "Alien Races", "First Open Contact", "Bashar", "Bashar Channeling", "Message to the Humanity", "Spiritual Awakening"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "is_live", "media_type": "video", "release_timestamp": null, "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_playlist/expire/1788039500/ei/7PySav6HHd75vPEP6fWNuAE/ip/2607:fb91:3c83:c07f:f921:38e3:3ccd:1b00/id/z